  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Integr av funkth barn</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integr disabled children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsens &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra villkoren f&#xf6;r funktionshindrade barn och ungdomar att integreras i skolverksamheten. Projektet ska &#xf6;ka kompetensniv&#xe5;n hos de specialister som &#xe4;r verksamma inom omr&#xe5;det, utveckla en modell f&#xf6;r distribution och framtagning av utbildningsmaterial f&#xf6;r funtionshindrade barn och ungdomar samt etablera en koordinationsenhe</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to set up a theoretical model and system of developing special educational materials for children and teenagers with special educational needs. All types of educational institutions and specialists in Lithuania working with students with special needs will be provided with special material. This will make the education more effective and open to all, regardless of needs.</narrative>
  </description>
